OL,3,GNEWSAGroundsman tells of 'horrendous'
OL,4,Ae-bike damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe groundsman of a 157-year-old
OL,7,Fcricket club has joined calls for
OL,8,FBradford Council to tackle the menace
OL,9,Fof illegal e-bike riders.
OL,11,FBilly Ricketts said the wicket and
OL,12,Foutfield of Saltaire Cricket Club had
OL,13,Fbeen repeatedly damaged over the summer
OL,14,Fby youths misusing the electric cycles.
OL,16,FLocal Labour MP Anna Dixon has written
OL,17,Fto the council's Reform leadership to
OL,18,Fask whether a #200,000 fund set up by
OL,19,Fthe previous Labour administration to
OL,20,Ftackle anti-social riding would be used
OL,21,Fto curb the problem.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
